{"id":"2307df4b4dd81212","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product.md","title":"ZFC Cardop Cardinal Product","display":"df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product — ZFC Cardop Cardinal Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product"],"display":"df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product — ZFC Cardop Cardinal Product","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-cartesian]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product — ZFC Cardop Cardinal Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"58-df-cartesian\">58-df-cartesian</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu\\in V\">\\(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\times:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"58-df-cartesian\">58-df-cartesian</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\approx:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\">\\(A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalProduct}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\lambda\\approx\\kappa\\times\\mu\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalProduct}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\lambda\\approx\\kappa\\times\\mu\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>二元基数积使用笛卡尔积与等势关系；原依赖的 <code>df-product</code> 定义的是索引族乘积，并非这里所需的二元积。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cartesian","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cartesian]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cartesian","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\times:V^2\\to V$ (see [[58-df-cartesian]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\approx:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)$，见 [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\times:V^2\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\approx:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardop\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardopCardinalProduct}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\lambda\\approx\\kappa\\times\\mu","display":true}],"bytes":1333,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1548","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product.md|58-df-zfc-cardop-cardinal-product]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","445e1cd0bb5274eb","28c79fde9f892bfe"]}